.com/DavidLNorris/status/1690244935566430209\">https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1690244935566430209</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1690244935566430209</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1690244935566430209\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-08-12T06:12:50Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>retweet</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1690247579890520064":{"a":"<p>There is no more appropriate time to discuss why these people died than while it is front and center. Climate isn&#x27;t the issue here. Governance is the issue. Climate, land usage/maintenance, etc are all policy decisions imposed upon these people who died.  #CriminalGovernments <a href=\"https://x.com/KanielaIng/status/1689336441598521344\">Tweet by @KanielaIng</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/KanielaIng/status/1689336441598521344\">https://x.com/KanielaIng/status/1689336441598521344</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1690247579890520064</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1690247579890520064\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-08-12T06:23:20Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1690249494070173696":{"a":"<p>This looks like a terribly stressful job. Being greeted as the bringer of fruit and piggyback rides by dangerous wild animals. <a href=\"https://x.com/_B___S/status/1690082556509564928\">Tweet by @_B___S</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/_B___S/status/1690082556509564928\">https://x.com/_B___S/status/1690082556509564928</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1690249494070173696</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1690249494070173696\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-08-12T06:30:57Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><